$ pakcs --nocypm -q :set safe :load Nat :eval 'natFromInt 3' :quit
I (I (I O))

$ pakcs --nocypm -q :set safe :load Nat :eval 'natToInt (I O)' :quit
1

$ pakcs --nocypm -q :set safe :load Nat :eval 'natFromInt 5' :quit
I (I (I (I (I O))))

$ pakcs --nocypm -q :set safe :eval 'toEnum 65' :quit
Overloaded type: Enum a => a
Cannot handle arbitrary overloaded top-level expressions
Hint: add type annotation to specialize the type
% exit status 1

$ pakcs --nocypm -q :set safe :eval '(toEnum 65) :: Char' :quit
'A'

